#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:5
msgid "Reference folio following"
msgstr "以下参考框"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:7
msgid ""
"Element which link the end of a `conductor`_ with the beginning of the "
"`conductor`_ represented at previous, following or the same `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"将 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的末端与以前代表的 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的开头，跟随或相同 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"的元素。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech reference folio following"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 参考文件如下："

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:15
msgid ""
"For reference folio following element exist two type of variables, the "
"general variables that are common for all type of `elements`_ and the "
"specific variables for this type of `element`_."
msgstr ""
"对于元素后面的参考folio,存在两类变量，即所有类型 `元件 <elements_>`_ 通用的一般变量和该类型 `元件 <element_>`_ "
"的特定变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech does not allow defining variable values for this type of "
"`element`_. QElectroTech does also not allows defining new variables. "
"QElectroTech allows only displaying the specific variables at `dynamic "
"texts`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech不允许定义该类型 `元件 <element_>`_ "
"的变量值。QEctroTech也不允许定义新的变量。QEctroTech只允许在 `动态文本 <dynamic texts_>`_ 上显示特定的变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:22
msgid "General variables"
msgstr "一般变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:24
msgid "**% {F}**: Label from the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be found."
msgstr "**% {F} (韩语)** 标签 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 地点 `元件 <element_>`_ 可见。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:25
msgid "**% {f}**: Number from the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be found."
msgstr "**% {f} (韩语)** 编号： `图幅 <folio_>`_ 地点 `元件 <element_>`_ 可见。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:26
msgid ""
"**% {M}**: Plant variable from the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be "
"found."
msgstr "**% {M}**:可以找到 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_ 的植物变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:27
msgid ""
"**% {LM}**: Location variable of the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be "
"found."
msgstr "**% {LM}**:可以找到 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_ 的位置变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:28
msgid ""
"**% {l}**: Folio line number from the `workspace`_ where the `element`_ can "
"be found."
msgstr "**% {l}**:可以找到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:29
msgid ""
"**% {c}**: Folio column number from the `workspace`_ where the `element`_ "
"can be found."
msgstr "**% {c}**:可以找到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_ 的Folio列号。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:30
msgid "**% {id}**: Folio position in the `project`_ (Schema number)."
msgstr "**% {id}**: `项目 <project_>`_ 中的Folio位置(计划编号)."

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:32
msgid "Specific variables"
msgstr "具体变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Function**: Function property from the `conductor`_ connected to the "
"`element terminal`_."
msgstr "**函数**: 来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 连接到 `元素终端 <element terminal_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Label**: Internal variable which defines the position of the linked "
"`previous reference folio`_ element."
msgstr "**标签**:定义链接 `先前的参考框 <previous reference folio_>`_ 元素位置的内部变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Voltage/Protocol**: Voltage/Protocol property from the `conductor`_ "
"connected to the `element terminal`_."
msgstr ""
"**Voltage/Protocol**:电压/Protocol属性来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 连接 `元素终端 <element "
"terminal_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The **Label** property can be defined as a formula by the user at `New "
"folio`_ section from `project properties`_. By default the formula is "
"``%id-%l%c``, variables took from `previous reference folio`_ linked "
"element."
msgstr ""
"**标签** 属性可以定义为用户在 `New folio <New folio_>`_ 节中从 `project 属性 <project "
"properties_>`_ 的公式。默认的公式是 ``%id-%l%c``,变量取自 `先前的参考 <previous reference "
"folio_>`_ 链接元素 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/reference_folio_following.rst:44
msgid ""
"For more information about how to define the **Label** formula, please "
"refers to `folio referencing project properties`_."
msgstr ""
"关于如何定义 **Label** 公式的更多信息，请参考 `folio参考项目属性 <folio referencing project "
"properties_>`_。"
